From ff0219c19b4172235e41e302a58dd47cb1d3a28a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
Date: Mon, 11 Apr 2022 12:56:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-66329] module: pci: move source file to lib common

Pci module is no longer used by preboot application only, in the next
patch it will also be used by the pif arc application. so it's being
moved to the common lib folder

Change-Id: Icd44f6a7b19e7e631ea4b96652185e0d8cc11fc7
Signed-off-by: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
---

